  abilityNotes: "FULLY IMPLEMENTED (HangedManAbility). Heal:1/Pentacle:1, condition
    (your Soul below the opponent's), and an optional ally target chosen AT PLAY
    TIME. The target is sacrificed and a Tree (HP 10, 7-tile cluster, Heal 1, Pentacle
    1, printed cost 0) grows centred on its anchor. Fit is checked before any mana
    is spent: all 7 tiles must be free (or the target's), on your side, and not where
    the Hanged Man itself will stand. The sacrifice is a REAL death (user decision)
    \u2014 a sacrificed Fool still burns mana, a sacrificed Tower still explodes
    \u2014 except that Death's 3-of-Swords passive stands down for it, since the
    Tree takes that ground."
